OL,3,GNEWSAMinister defends MSP colleague
OL,4,Aafter Transport Scotland blunder
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnergy Minister Stephen Gethins has
OL,7,Fdefended his MSP colleague Collette
OL,8,FStevenson after she asked whether the
OL,9,Fgovernment body Transport Scotland was
OL,10,Fa registered charity.
OL,12,FStevenson, who has been the SNP MSP for
OL,13,FEast Kilbride since 2021 and is a
OL,14,Ftransport committee member, made the
OL,15,Fblunder during Wednesday morning's
OL,16,Fcommittee meeting.
OL,18,FTransport Scotland director Graeme Cook
OL,19,Fhad to explain government agency
OL,20,Foperations to her before the meeting
OL,21,Fdrew to a close.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
