OL,3,GNEWSAMinister defends MSP colleague
OL,4,Aafter Transport Scotland blunder
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn BBC Radio, Gethins stood up for
OL,7,FStevenson's character, describing her
OL,8,Fas "a really good colleague and
OL,9,Ffantastic local advocate" but said it
OL,10,Fwould be unfair for him to comment on
OL,11,Fher committee question as he was not at
OL,12,Fthe meeting.
